---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import heroImage from '../assets/index-hero.png';
import fleetImage from '../assets/pahblo-fleet.png';
---

<BaseLayout title="Home">
  {/* Hero Section */}
  <section class="relative bg-slate-900 overflow-hidden border-b-8 border-amber-500 min-h-[85vh] flex items-center">
    
    {/* Background Image Setup */}
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
      <Image 
        src={heroImage} 
        alt="Pahblo Driving School Fleet and Instructor" 
        width={1920} 
        height={1080} 
        class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center"
      />
      {/* Gradient overlay to make text pop against the background */}
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-900/95 via-slate-900/70 to-slate-900/30"></div>
    </div>
    
    {/* Hero Content */}
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10 w-full py-20 lg:py-32">
      <div class="max-w-3xl text-center md:text-left mx-auto md:mx-0">
        <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-black text-white tracking-tighter mb-6 uppercase italic drop-shadow-md">
          Learn. Drive. <span class="text-red-500">Succeed.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-slate-200 mb-10 leading-relaxed font-medium drop-shadow max-w-2xl mx-auto md:mx-0">
          Professional, patient driving lessons in Phuthaditjhaba and the greater QwaQwa area. Master the K53 in our dual-controlled vehicles.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center md:justify-start gap-4 sm:gap-6">
          <a 
            href="/contact" 
            class="w-auto px-8 py-3 sm:px-10 sm:py-4 text-base sm:text-lg font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-900 bg-green-500 rounded-md shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(34,197,94,0.5)] hover:bg-green-400 hover:shadow-[0_0_25px_rgba(34,197,94,0.7)] hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300"
          >
            Start Learning
          </a>
          <a 
            href="/services" 
            class="w-auto px-8 py-3 sm:px-10 sm:py-4 text-base sm:text-lg font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-white bg-black/40 backdrop-blur-sm border-2 border-amber-500 rounded-md hover:bg-amber-500 hover:text-slate-900 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300"
          >
            View Packages
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* Why Us / Features Grid */}
  <section class="py-24 bg-slate-50">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 uppercase tracking-tight italic">The Pahblo <span class="text-red-600">Standard</span></h2>
        <div class="h-1 w-24 bg-amber-500 mx-auto mt-4 rounded-full"></div>
      </div>
      
      {/* Top Row: 3 Features */}
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-8">
        {/* Feature 1 - Red Hover */}
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-xl shadow-md border-b-4 border-transparent hover:border-red-600 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-slate-900 text-red-500 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-3 uppercase tracking-wide">Dual-Controlled</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 font-medium">Nervous? Don't be. Our vehicles are fitted with dual-controls so your instructor can step in instantly to keep you safe.</p>
        </div>

        {/* Feature 2 - Amber Hover */}
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-xl shadow-md border-b-4 border-transparent hover:border-amber-500 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-slate-900 text-amber-500 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-3 uppercase tracking-wide">Certified Instructors</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 font-medium">Patient, professional, and fully certified. We focus on teaching you how to drive safely, not just how to pass a test.</p>
        </div>

        {/* Feature 3 - Green Hover */}
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-xl shadow-md border-b-4 border-transparent hover:border-green-500 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-slate-900 text-green-500 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-3 uppercase tracking-wide">High Pass Rates</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 font-medium">Our structured lesson plans cover every aspect of the yard and road test, ensuring you walk into the DLTC fully prepared.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Bottom Row: 2 Features Centered */}
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        {/* Feature 4 - Red Hover */}
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-xl shadow-md border-b-4 border-transparent hover:border-red-600 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-slate-900 text-red-500 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 20l-5.447-2.724A1 1 0 013 16.382V5.618a1 1 0 011.447-.894L9 7l5.447-2.724A1 1 0 0116 5.618v10.764a1 1 0 01-1.447.894L9 20z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-3 uppercase tracking-wide">Local Route Mastery</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 font-medium">Extensive knowledge of the Phuthaditjhaba testing routes. We ensure you are completely familiar with every intersection and incline.</p>
        </div>

        {/* Feature 5 - Amber Hover */}
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-xl shadow-md border-b-4 border-transparent hover:border-amber-500 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-slate-900 text-amber-500 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-3 uppercase tracking-wide">Flexible Scheduling</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 font-medium">We know you have a busy life. Our lessons are structured to fit around your work or school timetable seamlessly.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  {/* Quick Services Snapshot */}
  <section class="py-24 bg-white border-t border-slate-200 overflow-x-hidden">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-8 uppercase tracking-tight italic">Ready for the <span class="text-amber-500">Road?</span></h2>
          <ul class="space-y-6">
            {/* Learner's License - Red */}
            <li class="flex items-start group">
              <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-red-100 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold mr-4 group-hover:bg-red-600 group-hover:text-white transition-colors">1</span>
              <p class="text-slate-700 text-lg"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-black uppercase tracking-wide block mb-1">Learner's License</strong> Comprehensive classes and study materials to help you ace your computerized theory test the first time.</p>
            </li>
            
            {/* Code 8 - Amber */}
            <li class="flex items-start group">
              <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-amber-100 text-amber-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold mr-4 group-hover:bg-amber-500 group-hover:text-white transition-colors">2</span>
              <p class="text-slate-700 text-lg"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-black uppercase tracking-wide block mb-1">Code 8 (Light Motor)</strong> Manual and automatic lessons covering clutch control, incline starts, and all K53 yard maneuvers.</p>
            </li>
            
            {/* Code 10 - Green */}
            <li class="flex items-start group">
              <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-green-100 text-green-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold mr-4 group-hover:bg-green-500 group-hover:text-white transition-colors">3</span>
              <p class="text-slate-700 text-lg"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-black uppercase tracking-wide block mb-1">Code 10 (Heavy Motor)</strong> Specialized training for driving larger vehicles, focusing on dimensions, turning circles, and safety.</p>
            </li>

            {/* Code 14 - Slate/Black */}
            <li class="flex items-start group">
              <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold mr-4 group-hover:bg-slate-900 group-hover:text-white transition-colors">4</span>
              <p class="text-slate-700 text-lg"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-black uppercase tracking-wide block mb-1">Code 14 (Extra Heavy)</strong> Advanced training for articulated vehicles and trailers. Prepare for your commercial driving career.</p>
            </li>
          </ul>
          <div class="mt-10">
            <div class="relative inline-flex group">
              {/* Traffic Light Ripples */}
              <div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-lg border-2 border-red-500 animate-ping opacity-75" style="animation-duration: 3s; animation-delay: 0s;"></div>
              <div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-lg border-2 border-amber-500 animate-ping opacity-75" style="animation-duration: 3s; animation-delay: 1s;"></div>
              <div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-lg border-2 border-green-500 animate-ping opacity-75" style="animation-duration: 3s; animation-delay: 2s;"></div>
              
              {/* Solid Premium Button */}
              <a href="/services" class="relative z-10 inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 text-lg font-black uppercase tracking-wide text-white bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg shadow-2xl hover:bg-slate-800 hover:border-slate-500 transition-all duration-300">
                <span class="flex items-center">
                  See all packages & pricing 
                  <span class="ml-3 text-amber-500 transform group-hover:translate-x-2 transition-transform duration-300">→</span>
                </span>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        {/* Fleet Image */}
        <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden border-4 border-slate-800 shadow-2xl relative group bg-slate-900">
          <Image 
            src={fleetImage} 
            alt="Pahblo Driving School Fleet" 
            width={1000} 
            height={750} 
            class="w-full h-auto transform group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
          />
          {/* Subtle overlay that fades out on hover */}
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-slate-900/10 group-hover:bg-transparent transition-colors duration-300"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  {/* Testimonials Section */}
  <section class="py-24 bg-slate-900 relative overflow-hidden">
    {/* Traffic Light Gradient Top Border */}
    <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-red-600 via-amber-500 to-green-500"></div>

    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-black text-white uppercase tracking-tight italic">Student <span class="text-green-500">Success Stories</span></h2>
        <div class="h-1 w-24 bg-amber-500 mx-auto mt-4 rounded-full"></div>
        <p class="mt-4 text-slate-400 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto font-medium">
          Don't just take our word for it. Here is what our newly licensed drivers have to say about their experience.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        {/* Testimonial 1 - Red Accent */}
        <div class="bg-slate-800/50 backdrop-blur-sm p-8 rounded-xl border-t-4 border-red-600 shadow-2xl flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-1 text-amber-400 mb-6">
              {[...Array(5)].map(() => (
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                  <path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z"></path>
                </svg>
              ))}
            </div>
            <p class="text-slate-300 mb-6 italic leading-relaxed">
              "I was incredibly nervous about driving around Phuthaditjhaba traffic, but my instructor was exceptionally patient. The dual-control vehicle gave me the confidence I needed to master my incline starts. Passed my yard test with zero penalties!"
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-auto">
            <p class="font-black text-white uppercase tracking-wider">Lerato M.</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-red-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mt-1">Code 8 Manual</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        {/* Testimonial 2 - Amber Accent */}
        <div class="bg-slate-800/50 backdrop-blur-sm p-8 rounded-xl border-t-4 border-amber-500 shadow-2xl flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-1 text-amber-400 mb-6">
              {[...Array(5)].map(() => (
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                  <path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z"></path>
                </svg>
              ))}
            </div>
            <p class="text-slate-300 mb-6 italic leading-relaxed">
              "The automatic lessons were exactly what I needed. Scheduling was so flexible around my work hours, and the K53 techniques were broken down simply. I finally have my license and I highly recommend them to any beginners."
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-auto">
            <p class="font-black text-white uppercase tracking-wider">Tshepo K.</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-amber-500 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mt-1">Code 8 Auto</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        {/* Testimonial 3 - Green Accent */}
        <div class="bg-slate-800/50 backdrop-blur-sm p-8 rounded-xl border-t-4 border-green-500 shadow-2xl flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-1 text-amber-400 mb-6">
              {[...Array(5)].map(() => (
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                  <path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z"></path>
                </svg>
              ))}
            </div>
            <p class="text-slate-300 mb-6 italic leading-relaxed">
              "Upgrading to a heavy motor vehicle license seemed daunting, but the instructors are true professionals. They know all the local testing routes and ensure you are 100% test-ready. Worth every single rand!"
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-auto">
            <p class="font-black text-white uppercase tracking-wider">Sipho D.</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-green-500 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mt-1">Code 10</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>